flowchart TB
    INPUT["01 · Student request<br/>Question, selected SQL or quotation"]
    SCOPE["02 · Capture request ownership<br/>Workspace, conversation, database identity and revision"]
    CONTEXT["03 · Assemble the context<br/>Teacher rules, actual schema, relevant history and exact current question"]
    CAPACITY{"04 · Does the context fit<br/>the model window?"}
    COMPACT["Compact older material only when needed<br/>Keep original source IDs and complete archives"]
    MODEL["05 · Call the selected model<br/>Chat Completions, Messages or Responses; account/API transport"]
    TOOL{"06 · Did the model request<br/>a read-only tool?"}
    READTOOL["Read sources within request scope and budgets<br/>read_context: archived sources<br/>inspect_database: captured database observations"]
    ANSWER["07 · Validate the answer contract<br/>Separate explanation, teaching examples and one complete runnable SQL batch"]
    GUARD{"08 · Is the request still current<br/>and the action permitted?"}
    STOP["Cancel or reject stale work<br/>Do not apply delayed SQL to another workspace or revision"]
    ROUTE{"09 · Choose the permitted<br/>execution path"}
    TEXT["Explanation only<br/>Display text and non-runnable teaching examples"]
    READ["Read-only worker<br/>Snapshot or connection; deadline and result limits"]
    WRITE["AI write batch<br/>SAVEPOINT; constraints, triggers and applicable preservation checks"]
    EDITOR["Independent entry: manual SQL editor"]
    MANUAL["Manual SQL / explicit transaction<br/>Separate execution contract and actual partial or transaction state"]
    RESULT["10 · Record the observed outcome<br/>Actual tables, complete SQL, errors and changes with source identities"]
    REPAIR{"Eligible failure and shared<br/>repair budget still unused?"}
    CORRECT["One conditional repair<br/>Use the original request and actual error or evidence; check the complete answer again"]
    SHOW["11 · Show the outcome<br/>Actual results beside the explanation; expose errors and changes"]
    MEMORY["12 · Keep evidence for follow-up questions<br/>Conversation, operation records and complete result archives"]
    INPUT --> SCOPE --> CONTEXT --> CAPACITY
    CAPACITY -- Yes --> MODEL
    CAPACITY -- Pressure --> COMPACT --> MODEL
    MODEL --> TOOL
    TOOL -- Yes --> READTOOL --> MODEL
    TOOL -- No --> ANSWER --> GUARD
    GUARD -- No --> STOP
    GUARD -- Yes --> ROUTE
    ROUTE -- Explanation only --> TEXT --> SHOW
    ROUTE -- Read --> READ --> RESULT
    ROUTE -- AI write --> WRITE --> RESULT
    GUARD ~~~ EDITOR
    EDITOR --> MANUAL --> RESULT
    ANSWER -. Format failure .-> REPAIR
    RESULT -. Eligible execution or teaching failure .-> REPAIR
    REPAIR -- Yes --> CORRECT --> ANSWER
    REPAIR -- No --> SHOW
    RESULT --> SHOW --> MEMORY
    MEMORY -. Next question retrieves its sources .-> CONTEXT
